  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant-Foroige leadership for life prog-Grade10&amp;11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The For&#xf3;ige Leadership for Life programme objective at Nsobe School is to address the problems with the youth by building confidence, critical thinking, teamwork, leadership skills and community engagement skills with the objective of empowering young people to make informed life choices, and contribute positively to their communities. The Kwabuka Bridging course equips students with essential life skills, career guidance, and personal development tools enabling them to cross into tertiary education pathways, careers and meaningful community leadership. Nsobe Computer Room Extension: Building and installing an internet-connected computer classroom in Nsobe aims to equip remote rural students with vital digital literacy, enhance teaching through access to online resources and self-learning.</narrative>
  </description>
